**Turn 9:** "not at all" negates a concern B raised about the house's condition (likely whether it was neglected or in bad shape).

**Turn 11:** The retained claim captures B asking about age. But "There were a few repairs that needed doing, but it didn't take a lot of money or time" suggests B also asked about repairs/condition, or expressed concern about repair costs/time.

